{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Ho.</b> A word of calling, and the meaning concerns Assyria." "<b>As you laid waste, O spoiler.</b> Because you are a spoiler, you shall be laid waste." "<b>When you cease.</b> Like כהנלותך, and similar to it: ולא ירד [should be יטה] לארץ מנלם (Job 15:29)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {2 "The manuscript reading ירד is marked as erroneous for יטה; both the Hebrew forms and the correction notation are translated as found."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:25.871295212Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}